    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061227.0264\n\nADDIS ABABA, Dec 27 , 2006, 2006\n\ndelay'\n\n\n\n\nThe African Union on Wednesday told Ethiopia to pull out thousands of its troops from Somalia \"without delay.\"\n\n\"We are calling for the withdrawal of Ethiopian troops without delay,\" AU Commission chairman Alpha Omar Konare said in the body's headquarters in Addis Ababa.",
